    },
    {
      "value": "Excludes transparency and accountability from quantitative benchmarking, leaving two of eight principles unevaluated.",
      "ev": {
        "page": 7,
        "section": "1 Introduction",
        "quote": "we have established a benchmark for six of these aspects due to the difficulty of benchmarking transparency and accountability",
