      "ev": {
        "page": 35,
        "section": "7.1 Jailbreak",
        "quote": "numerous optimization-based jailbreak approaches exhibit relatively complex prompt construction, and some are limited to white-box LLMs ... thus impeding their generalizability for our benchmark. Consequently, these methods are not incorporated into our dataset.",
